Provide in depth analysis of data using data mining and profiling techniques to help FCSA understand industry and customer behaviour and predict future behaviour;
Defines, implements and standardises metrics, reports and visualisations for the business;
Deliver key metrics, reports and visualisations with interpretation, contributes to the development of hypothesis and actions;
Guides, enhances the skills set and develops the data analysis team;
Manage a team of resources, business plan and budget;
