To be considered for this position, candidates must be in possession of:
an Honour’s degree (NQF 8) or an equivalent qualification;
experience in an IT technical environment, with the emphasis on payment systems (domestic and cross-border), treasury management systems, banking systems, regulatory financial reporting systems and financial messaging systems (SWIFT);
