Brief description
The main purpose of this position is to support the Cyber and Information Security Unit (CISU) Head in driving and maturing cyber and information security within the South African Reserve Bank (SARB) Group as well as to coordinate the reporting, governance and budgeting functions.
Detailed description
The successful candidate will be responsible for the following key performance areas:
Support the divisional budgeting process by anticipating requirements, ensuring overall coordination and submission of information for budget preparation; scheduling expenditures; monitoring costs and analysing variances.
